<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8485" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνερείπομαι</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		Dep., used by <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> only in 3pl.
		aor., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>snatch up and
				carry off,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνηρείψαντο,</span> of the gods, <i><span class="en">
				11.20.234
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Pae.</u>
				6.136
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.503
			</span></i>; of the Harpies, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.241
			</span></i>, etc.; of storms, <i><span class="en">
				4.727
			</span></i>; so 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖδα . . Ἀφροδίτη ὦρτ᾽ ἀνερειψαμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					990
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Ἀργὼ οὐρανὸς ἀνηρείψατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Them.
					<u>Or.</u>
					27.333a
				</span></i>
			:—later, <i>take upon oneself,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>A.</u>
					290
				</span></i>
			. (The true spelling is prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνηρεψ-,</span> which has Ms. authority in Hes.l.c. and <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.214
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ[νᾱ]ρέψατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Pae.</u>
				</span></i>
			l.c., and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνερεψάμενοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπυια.</span>
			)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
